# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  MEDICAL DATA
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# The main project safeguard. ALL contents of Data/ are ignored by default
# to prevent accidentally committing your own medical record.
#
# The usual logic is reversed: hide everything and list a few exceptions.
# A mistake keeps a file out of Git rather than leaking it.

Data/**

# Exceptions: directory structure, templates, and system knowledge.
# None of these contain, or should contain, personal data.
!Data/**/
!Data/**/.gitkeep
!Data/**/README.md
!Data/**/*.example.json
!Data/**/*.example.jsonl
!Data/**/*.example.csv
!Data/**/*.demo.json
!Data/**/*.demo.jsonl
!Data/**/*.demo.csv

# Markdown templates: visit notes and patterns. Only templates use the
# .example and .demo suffixes; real records never do, so this exception
# does not weaken the safeguard above.
!Data/**/*.example.md
!Data/**/*.demo.md

# Single-entry format references: a lab result or visit note.
# Unlike .example files, these are NOT deployed by the installer: they
# illustrate an entry rather than a container file to initialize.
# Deploying one would create a lab result missing from the index.
!Data/**/*.reference.json
!Data/**/*.reference.md

# System reference data, not patient data
!Data/labs/_marker-aliases.json
!Data/specialists/*.json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  ORIGINAL DOCUMENTS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# PDFs, scans, and images contain raw PHI: full names, dates of birth,
# insurance numbers, and clinic stamps. In Git they survive deletion
# from the working directory and reappear when history is shared.

*.pdf
*.dcm
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.heic
*.tif
*.tiff
*.dicom

# Except dashboard icons and static assets
!Dashboard/public/**

# And documentation illustrations. Screenshots use synthetic demo data
# for a fictional patient and contain no real personal information
!docs/img/**

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  WORKING DIRECTORIES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# The `!<directory>/**/` line is required before unignored files:
# Git cannot unignore a file inside an ignored directory. Without this
# line, nested .gitkeep files silently disappear and clones lack
# the Cache/alerts, Cache/sessions, and Archive/processed subdirectories.

Inbox/**
!Inbox/**/
!Inbox/**/.gitkeep

Archive/**
!Archive/**/
!Archive/**/.gitkeep

Cache/**
!Cache/**/
!Cache/**/.gitkeep

Goals/**
!Goals/**/
!Goals/**/.gitkeep

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SECRETS
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.mcp.json
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials.json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  CLAUDE CODE RUNTIME
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Session breadcrumbs contain absolute paths with the username
.claude/hooks/pending-sessions/*.json
.claude/hooks/session-start-*.tmp
.claude/projects/
.claude/settings.local.json

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  DASHBOARD
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Dashboard/node_modules/
Dashboard/.next/
Dashboard/out/
Dashboard/.env.local
Dashboard/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  CONFLICTING COPIES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# iCloud Drive, Dropbox, and Finder create duplicates such as "settings 2.json".
# Claude Code does not read them, but they resemble a second source of truth
# beside the real file, with differences hidden in their contents.
# A copy containing outdated access permissions was once published this way.

* [0-9].*
*[Cc]opy.*
* copy.*
*conflicted copy*

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  SYSTEM FILES
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
.vscode/
.idea/
